; Glucosepane arginine-derived marker (AGS), embedded in a peptide chain.
;
; Bead correspondence (glucosepane model):
;   BB  = B2, SC1 = S2, SC2 = R6, SC3 = R5 (virtual site in the 20 fs set),
;   SC4 = R4, SC5 = R1 (shared LGX/AGS bead, hosted once on AGS),
;   SC6 = R2 (virtual site in the 20 fs set), SC7 = R3; all beads carry mass in the 10 fs set.
;
; The initial SC5 coordinate is supplied by AGS:NZ.  As in ColBuilder's PYD
; strategy, this marker-local placement is only the starting geometry; the
; complete G21 bonded network controls the subsequent relaxation.

[ molecule ]
AGS

[from]
amber99

[to]
martini300C

[ martini ]
BB SC1 SC2 SC3 SC4 SC5 SC6 SC7

